      "text": "This area is home to CF Shops at Don Mills, a \"lifestyle centre-type\" outdoor shopping mall.\n\nCF Shops at Don Mills is an outdoor shopping center described as a \"lively community gathering place\" with \"gourmet restaurants and cozy cafés.\"\n\nThe area is a mixed-use development, with residential and retail spaces integrated.\n\nThe existing cafes mentioned in the area do not currently offer indoor playgrounds, indicating that this would be a new concept for the immediate vicinity.\n\nTheir menu includes various ramen options, sushi sets, and appetizers.\n\nThey also have a Courtyard Café for lighter meals, sweets, and beverages.\n\nThe location is situated within CF Shops at Don Mills, a \"lifestyle centre-type\" shopping center.\n\nIt is easily accessible by car, with on-site parking available along internal streets, in surface lots, and a multi-level parkade.\n\nThe area also has public transit routes.\n\nThe center is described as having a layout similar to a regular neighborhood retail area, with storefronts facing internal streets and a central square.",
